  "body": "Found while fixing #49 against HEIDENHAIN TNC 640 User's Manual, ISO programming, ID 892909-25 (9/2016). The manual's programs carry N block numbers, signed coordinate words (X+25) and a * block terminator; assets/posts/heidenhain.cps writes none of these. Its G81-G89 drilling cycles are also not the cycle forms that manual documents.\n\nDone means: for each item, check the manual whether the TNC rejects or misreads the current form; fix the post where it would, regenerate the Heidenhain goldens with a reviewed diff, and pin with a test; record any item judged harmless in RECOMMENDED.md with the manual page.",
